# M4 headless flow test (bopl-port --headless --drive scripts/dev/m4-flow.drive
#   --screenshot scratch/m4/flow.png): main menu -> character select (keyboard +
# mouse and two controllers join, colour, team, ability grid, ready) -> start ->
# 3 rounds played by bots (the devices drive menus and the wheel) -> mid-game
# ability wheel -> winner screen -> back to character select -> main menu.
# Syntax: crates/game/src/driver.rs.
60 shot 01-menu
8 press km down
10 shot 02-menu-online-selected
8 press km up
10 press km accept
0 wait charsel
40 shot 03-charsel
8 press km accept            # keyboard + mouse joins box 0
15 press pad0 accept         # controller 0 joins box 1
15 press pad1 start          # controller 1 joins box 2
30 shot 04-joined
# km: team row -> colour row, next colour, then ready
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km right
8 press km right
# pad0: ability top row -> grid -> pick
8 press pad0 down
8 press pad0 accept
20 press pad0 right
8 press pad0 down
8 press pad0 down
20 shot 05-grid
8 press pad0 accept
# pad1: team 3
8 press pad1 right
20 shot 06-select
8 press km down
8 press km accept           # km ready
8 press pad0 start          # pad0 ready
8 press pad1 start          # pad1 ready
30 shot 07-ready
8 press km accept           # start!
0 wait match
0 bot km
0 bot pad0
0 bot pad1
40 shot 08-flyin
0 wait round
60 shot 09-round
8 press km select            # pause prompt (Esc)
20 shot 09b-pause
8 press km right
15 shot 09c-pause-leave-selected
8 press km left
8 press km back              # close it again
# a loser can use the wheel (mid-round with 3 players, or on the winner screen)
0 wait wheel any
8 press loser up 4
30 shot 10-wheel-open
8 press loser left 4
20 press loser down 4
20 press loser left 4
20 shot 11-wheel-changed
8 press loser jump 4
0 wait winner
10 shot 12-winner-1
40 shot 13-winner-1-prompts
8 press km jump              # next level
0 wait level
60 shot 14-level-2
0 wait winner
60 shot 15-winner-2
8 press pad0 start           # next level
0 wait level
0 wait winner
60 shot 16-winner-3
8 press km select            # "ability select": back to character select
0 wait charsel
40 shot 17-charsel-back
8 press km back              # km leaves its box (select -> join)
10 press km back             # Esc without a box: back to the main menu
0 wait menu
60 shot 18-menu-again
5 quit
